he horrors that await you. Visit different haunted houses, steal the cursed items ordered by the mysterious organization, and get out before you are caught. A horrible fate lurks in the shadows, ready to claim the life of anyone foolish enough to enter their domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special thanks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contributors to the compilation &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@YeenaGames / YouTube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@AndrewLaughsOfficial / Youtube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@dnnyfntm / Twitch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">@Derogancia / Twitch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is still in development and certain aspects may change from what can be seen and are described.\u00a0Join our Discord community to follow the development, find fellow burglars to play with, and share your ideas for the game!</i></p>","developers":["Studio Downstairs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223330/header.jpg?t=1750850845","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108359,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108359/movie480.mp4?t=1740771903","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108359/movie_max.mp4?t=1740771903"},"name":"Find or be Found - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108359/213bacaca43e0f8383ea3819f803931ffc78e887/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740771903","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25710835